      en: ["Original commissioning occurred in the year 1904", "The Central Shaft reaches a depth of 1,204 meters", "Target production of 80,000 ounces of gold per year", "Features a dedicated 12-megawatt solar power plant", "Operated by the Caledonia Mining Corporation", "Located in the mineral-rich Gwanda Greenstone Belt"],
