      en: ["Established in Gweru in 1939", "Largest footwear manufacturer in Zimbabwe", "Production capacity of several million pairs annually", "Manufacturer of the world-famous Safari boots", "Features on-site tanneries for leather processing", "Major employer in the Midlands Province region"],
